[00:00.00] 作词 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:00.00][by:TripleChris]
[00:00.80] 作曲 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:14.56]See all the sound
[00:14.56]环顾四周
[00:15.85]Taste the smell
[00:15.85]品尝这份滋味
[00:16.80]Touch the color in the air
[00:16.80]触碰空气里的色彩
[00:18.67]Everywhere
[00:18.67]遍地蔓延
[00:19.55]Slipping under your skin
[00:19.55]滑至你的皮肤里
[00:22.16]Feel overwhelmed by the sense
[00:22.16]窒息的感觉袭来
[00:24.06]Something big is starting
[00:24.06]蓄势待发
[00:25.93]Even if you’re not ready
[00:25.93]要是你还没准备好
[00:27.41]Time to begin
[00:27.41]现在可以开始了
[00:29.27]What brought you here in the first place?
[00:29.27]谁先带你来过这里呢
[00:32.72]The last place you’d ever go
[00:32.72]你上一个去的地方是哪里
[00:36.05]Your eyes
[00:36.05]你的双眼
[00:38.22]Spinning like a satellite
[00:38.22]如同卫星般转动
[00:42.00]Taking everything in sight
[00:42.00]视线里占据了一切
[00:45.67]Never stop to blink
[00:45.67]别眨眼
[00:47.00]Never stop to think
[00:47.00]别眨眼
[00:48.41]Everything is moving at the pace of light
[00:48.41]一切都踏着光的步伐
[00:54.88]Fast moving
[00:54.88]快速运转着
[00:55.69]Ground shaking
[00:55.69]地面开始颤动
[00:56.64]Almost like the sky is falling
[00:56.64]好似天幕坠落
[00:58.49]Never take a second just to catch… your breath
[00:58.49]屏住呼吸
[01:02.30]Lights flashing
[01:02.30]光线闪烁
[01:03.05]Sounds clashing
[01:03.05]尘世喧嚣
[01:03.92]Even in the madness
[01:03.92]甚至陷入疯狂
[01:05.80]Everything seems to click
[01:05.80]一切似乎都在咔嗒作响
[01:07.14]Like a perfect match
[01:07.14]犹如绝配
[01:09.64]What drew you here in the first place?
[01:09.64]谁先带你到这里来的呢
[01:12.89]The last place you’ll ever know
[01:12.89]最后一个地方你也无从所知
[01:16.25]Your eyes
[01:16.25]你的双眼
[01:18.67]Spinning like a satellite
[01:18.67]如同卫星般转动
[01:20.92]Taking everything in sight
[01:20.92]视线里占据了一切
[01:25.92]Never stop to blink
[01:25.92]别眨眼
[01:27.56]Never stop to think
[01:27.56]别眨眼
[01:28.68]Everything is moving at a pace of light
[01:28.68]一切都踏着光的步伐
[01:32.41]If you want to slow down
[01:32.41]要是你想慢下来
[01:35.53]Shut your eyes and just try not to think about it
[01:35.53]闭上双眼，试着放空
[01:39.09]If you’re ever in doubt
[01:39.09]要是你有所疑惑
[01:42.23]Look around my friend and just take it in
[01:42.23]四下环顾，你便能领会
[02:04.29]Your eyes
[02:04.29]你的双眼
[02:06.38]Spinning like a satellite
[02:06.38]犹如卫星闪烁
[02:09.96]Taking everything in sight
[02:09.96]占据了视线
[02:13.66]Never stop to blink
[02:13.66]别眨眼
[02:14.91]Never stop to think
[02:14.91]别眨眼
[02:16.25]Everything is moving at the pace of light
[02:16.25]一切都如光速快速运转着
